abstract: >-
  Reproducible RNA-seq and ChIP-seq re-analysis of GSE85246 focused on
  persistent kinase-associated transcriptional states after LPS exposure,
  beta-glucan rescue and restimulation, and associated H3K27ac/H3K4me1
  chromatin patterns.
keywords:
